  "result": "Excellent! All 45 tests pass. I've added two functions for modifying invoices:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds or updates a line:\n- Adds a new line at the end if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Increases qty if the SKU already exists\n- Validates qty (positive integer), SKU existence, and invoice status\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` or error (QTY_INVALID, UNKNOWN_SKU, NOT_DRAFT)\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line by SKU:\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` without that line\n- Error LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU isn't on invoice\n- Error NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n- Error NOT_DRAFT if invoice isn't in draft status\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` on success\n\n**New error codes:**\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 invoice status must be 'draft' to modify\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 SKU not found on invoice\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- Adding new lines and updating existing lines\n- All error cases (qty, SKU, status, removal constraints)\n- Input immutability\n- Chaining multiple operations\n\nAll 45 tests pass \u2713",
